        "type": "Module",
        "name": "power_3v3",
        "description": "AMS1117-3.3 linear regulator converts the external VIN_5V rail into the regulated VCC_3V3 output rail. This module is the sole provider of the internally generated 3.3V rail and serves as the power distribution source for downstream consumers. The regulator uses VIN, VOUT, and GND only as provided in the component data; input/output stability and decoupling are implemented later with passives. The generated VCC_3V3 rail must also be routed to the supervisor sensing and supply inputs so POWER_GOOD reflects the actual regulated output rail.",
